    {
      "id": "MJUe",
      "code_hash": "8c33e29a2281a7075cfbbb8de3ccd66f",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"kompresia-obrazu-dft-vs-dct\">Kompresia obrazu: DFT vs. DCT</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>CSO 2026/27 \u00b7 cvi\u010denie 5</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Obraz rekon\u0161truujeme len z K najv\u00e4\u010d\u0161\u00edch koeficientov transform\u00e1cie. \u010c\u00edm menej koeficientov,\nt\u00fdm hor\u0161ia kvalita. Pri rovnakom K je DCT spravidla lep\u0161ia ne\u017e DFT.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "vblA",
      "code_hash": "dc92246bf9c1d97c5e81cd9d1ccdf536",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-teoria\">1. Te\u00f3ria</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>2D DFT</strong> obrazu <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x[m,n]||)</marimo-tex> ve\u013ekosti <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(M\\times N||)</marimo-tex>:</span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\nX[k_1,k_2]=\\sum_{m=0}^{M-1}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1} x[m,n]\\,e^{-2\\pi i\\left(\\frac{k_1 m}{M}+\\frac{k_2 n}{N}\\right)}\n||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>2D DCT-II</strong> (ortonorm\u00e1lna):</span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\nC[k_1,k_2]=\\alpha_{k_1}\\alpha_{k_2}\\sum_{m,n} x[m,n]\\cos\\frac{\\pi(2m+1)k_1}{2M}\\cos\\frac{\\pi(2n+1)k_2}{2N},\\qquad\n\\alpha_0=\\sqrt{\\tfrac{1}{M}},\\ \\alpha_k=\\sqrt{\\tfrac{2}{M}}\n||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Aproxim\u00e1cia K koeficientmi:</strong> ponech\u00e1me mno\u017einu <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\Omega_K||)</marimo-tex> s K najv\u00e4\u010d\u0161\u00edmi <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(|C[k]|||)</marimo-tex>, ostatn\u00e9 vynulujeme a urob\u00edme inverzn\u00fa transform\u00e1ciu.\nZ Parsevalovej rovnosti je relat\u00edvna chyba dan\u00e1 energiou zahoden\u00fdch koeficientov:</span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\n\\frac{\\|x-\\hat x\\|^2}{\\|x\\|^2}=\\frac{\\sum_{k\\notin\\Omega_K}|C[k]|^2}{\\sum_k |C[k]|^2}\n||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Pre\u010do je DCT lep\u0161ia:</strong> DFT implicitne predpoklad\u00e1 periodick\u00e9 pokra\u010dovanie obrazu. \u013dav\u00fd okraj sa napoj\u00ed na prav\u00fd, vznikne skok a jeho energia sa rozpt\u00fdli do mnoh\u00fdch vysok\u00fdch frekvenci\u00ed. DCT zodpoved\u00e1 symetrick\u00e9mu (zrkadlov\u00e9mu) pokra\u010dovaniu bez skoku, tak\u017ee energia je s\u00fastreden\u00e1 v men\u0161om po\u010dte koeficientov.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
